# Build artefacts
/arc-ui
/.bin/
# `go build` inside the nested screenshot module drops its binary next to the
# source. The PNGs it produces ARE committed — they are what README.md embeds.
/tools/screenshot/screenshot

# Generated: templ output and the Tailwind bundle. Both are reproduced by
# `task gen`, so they are not worth reviewing in a diff.
#
# TRAP: internal/web/static is consumed by a `go:embed` of the whole directory,
# and go:embed FAILS AT COMPILE TIME on a directory with no files at all. That is
# why internal/web/static/.gitkeep is committed — without it a fresh clone does
# not build until Tailwind has run once.
*_templ.go
internal/web/static/app.css

# SQLite history database (ARC_UI_DB_PATH), plus its WAL sidecars.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Claude Code worktrees and local session state.
.claude/
